{"e":{"einmal":[{"p":"adv","i":"/ˈaɪ̯nmaːl/","a":"7/75/De-einmal.ogg","s":[["once, one time (one and only one time)",[],[["Ich werde das nur einmal sagen.","I'm only going to say it once."],["Einmal ist keinmal.","Literally \"Once is never.\" (Doing something one time is meaningless)"]]],["once (formerly; during some period in the past)",[],[["Es war einmal eine schöne Prinzessin.","There was once a beautiful princess."]]],["sometime (at an indefinite but stated time in the past or future)",[],[]],["first of all, for starters, firstly (as an initial point; before any other considerations)",[],[]],["one order (of food)",[],[["Einmal Pommes, bitte.","I'll have (one order of) fries, please."]]]],"et":"From Middle High German einmāle, equivalent to ein + -mal. Compare Middle Low German ênmâl.","r":1973}],"einmal ist keinmal":[{"p":"proverb","a":"4/4b/De-einmal_ist_keinmal.ogg","s":[["Once doesn’t count; one swallow does not a summer make",[],[["Mein Mann macht wirklich Fortschritte: Letztens hat er von selber den Abwasch gemacht! — Pah... Einmal ist keinmal.","My husband is really making some progress. A while ago, he decided all by himself to do the dishes! — Pfft... One time. Big deal!"]]],["One slip is allowed; everyone deserves a second chance",[],[["Solches Verhalten werden wir an dieser Schule nicht dulden! Aber... ich sage mal: Einmal ist keinmal.","We will not tolerate such behaviour at this school! But... let me say: As long as it doesn’t happen again, we’ll forget about it."]]],["One time won’t hurt; just try it",[],[["Die Sarah will mit mir zu so’ner nervigen Autorenlesung. — Tu’s halt ihr zuliebe. Einmal ist keinmal.","Sarah wants me to go to this annoying book reading with her. — Well, so do it for her sake. This one time won’t be so bad."]]]],"et":"Literally, “once is never”."}],"einmalig":[{"p":"adj","i":"/ˈaɪ̯nˌmaːlɪç/","a":"e/e7/De-einmalig3.ogg","s":[["non-recurring, one-time, oncely",[],[["einmalige Gebühr.","one-time fee."]]],["singular, unique",[],[